<title>Test cases</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>HighCardinalityImageBatch : concurrent image batch inference at scale</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ConcurrentInferenceStress : parallel inference requests</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ModelReloadStress : concurrent model reload under load</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
